  "sourceTitle": "Cream Cheese Frosting ^^",
  "sourceText": "Cream Cheese Frosting ^^\nBy: Michelle Tancioco\nPublished: Wednesday, February 23, 2011 - 12:36am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 packages (8 ounce) cream cheese, softened\n1/2 cup butter, softened\n2 cups sifted confectioners' sugar\n1 teaspoon vanilla extract\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a medium bowl, cream together the cream cheese and butter until creamy. Mix in the vanilla, then gradually stir in the confectioners' sugar.",
